{"study_accession":"PRJNA735194","secondary_study_accession":"SRP322732","title":"Differentially Expressed Mitochondrial Circulating mRNA in Hypothyroidism Could Be Useful as a Survivor Biomarker in Nonthyroidal Illness Syndrome","description":"RNA libraries were constructed from whole blood. We called hypothyroidism differentially expressed genes with the Noiseq. We found a total of 4,197 transcripts regulated by the thyroid hormone present in the peripheral blood. We also found that three hundred and thirty-six (8.01%) were mitochondrial genes type. Overall design: It was constructed libraries of four subjects with TSH within reference range to compose the control (CTL) group and four hypothyroidism patients (HT).","pubmed":"37249456","geo_series":"","n_samples":8,"study_labels":[],"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN19570272","study_accession":"PRJNA735194","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"HT4","description":"HT4","sex":"female","geo_sample":"GSM5357071","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-06-08","attributes":[["source_name","whole blood"],["tissue","whole blood"],["disease","hypothyroidism"],["sex","female"],["age","51"],["tsh","100"],["ft4","0.1"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR14730355","experiment_accession":"SRX11067364","library_layout":"SINGLE","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"Ion Torrent Proton","read_count":12357699,"base_count":1331405159,"first_public":"2021-06-08","experiment_title":"Ion Torrent Proton sequencing: GSM5357071: HT4 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMN19570273","study_accession":"PRJNA735194","blood_class":"whole_blood","class_from":"sample","title":"HT3","description":"HT3","sex":"female","geo_sample":"GSM5357070","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-06-08","attributes":[["source_name","whole blood"],["tissue","whole blood"],["disease","hypothyroidism"],["sex","female"],["age","52"],["tsh","58.7"],["ft4","0.1